%% Runtime: one AskUserQuestion call, from the catch to the answer.
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Session (agent)
    participant H as Question hook
    participant P as Pane
    participant R as priority-dev CLI
    participant E as Engineer
    S->>H: tool.call AskUserQuestion
    alt reader off, subagent, or pane cannot open
        H->>S: next(e), the dialog opens
    else main loop, reader on
        H->>P: open and focus, question card
        H->>R: digest, then interpret --open-question
        E->>P: picks options, types Other
        R-->>P: reading, stop_kind question
        E->>P: Send
        P->>H: answers
        H->>S: { result } with the answers
    end
